WEBVTT

00:10:28.895 --> 00:10:30.407
This is what an image looks like

00:10:30.407 --> 00:10:32.283
from your cell phone.

00:10:32.283 --> 00:10:33.296
But this is what it looks like

00:10:33.296 --> 00:10:35.187
in a visual abstraction.

00:10:35.187 --> 00:10:37.172
This is what your music looks like,

00:10:37.172 --> 00:10:39.375
but here's its visual abstraction.

00:10:39.375 --> 00:10:41.135
Most importantly for me,

00:10:41.135 --> 00:10:44.410
this is what the code on your cell phone looks like.

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:46.567
This is what I'm after in the end,

00:10:46.567 --> 00:10:48.707
but this is its visual abstraction.

00:10:48.707 --> 00:10:51.216
If I can find this, I can't make the phone explode.

00:10:51.216 --> 00:10:53.835
I could spend weeks trying to find this

00:10:53.835 --> 00:10:55.012
in ones and zeros,

00:10:55.012 --> 00:10:56.796
but it takes me seconds to pick out

00:10:56.796 --> 00:11:00.100
a visual abstraction like this.